sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SDK as codeflare-sdk<br/>(workbench process)
    participant FS as Local FS<br/>~/.local/share/codeflare/tls
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant KR as KubeRay Operator
    participant GW as Data-science Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Head as Ray Head<br/>8265 dashboard / 10001 client

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over SDK,KR: Flow 1 - Create Ray cluster: cf.clusters.create(cfg).apply()
    SDK->>API: GET kueue.x-k8s.io LocalQueues<br/>Bearer token (user)
    API-->>SDK: default LocalQueue
    SDK->>API: Server-side apply ray.io/v1 RayCluster<br/>label kueue.x-k8s.io/queue-name, enableIngress: false
    KR->>API: Create head/workers, CA secret, HTTPRoute<br/>Operator SA
    SDK->>API: Poll/read cluster-ca-secret-* (incl. tls.key)<br/>Bearer token (user)
    API-->>SDK: CA cert + CA private key
    SDK->>FS: Write ca.crt / tls.crt / tls.key (0600)<br/>RSA-3072, SHA-256, 30-day
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over SDK,Head: Flow 2 - Submit job via dashboard: RayJobClient
    SDK->>API: List HTTPRoutes / Gateway / GatewayConfig / Routes<br/>(403 fallback: probe fixed namespaces)
    API-->>SDK: https://host/ray/ns/cluster
    SDK->>GW: POST/GET Ray Jobs REST API<br/>HTTPS TLS, Authorization: Bearer (OpenShift only)
    GW->>Head: Forward to dashboard 8265/TCP<br/>Gateway-enforced auth (kube-auth-proxy)
    Head-->>GW: Job status / logs
    GW-->>SDK: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 225)
    Note over SDK,Head: Flow 3 - Submit RayJob CR: cf.jobs.create(...)
    SDK->>API: Create ray.io/v1 RayJob<br/>clusterSelector or rayClusterSpec + Kueue labels
    SDK->>API: Create Opaque Secret (zipped local files)<br/>ownerRef to RayJob, controller=true
    KR->>Head: Submitter pod (mounts Secret) submits job<br/>8265/TCP HTTP in-cluster
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
    Note over SDK,Head: Flow 4 - Interactive Ray client
    SDK->>Head: ray://cluster-head-svc.ns.svc:10001<br/>gRPC, mTLS (RAY_USE_TLS), SDK-minted client cert
    Head-->>SDK: Ray client session
    end
